Change files: one Markdown file per change that users will notice. The release pull request
collects them into CHANGELOG.md and deletes them. Make one with `knope document-change`, or by
hand:

    ---
    default: minor
    ---

    # Compare results from two different versions

    Any more detail goes here, under the title.

The type is `major` (it breaks something that worked), `minor` (a new feature) or `patch` (a
fix). See docs/releasing.md.

This file has no .md ending, so knope does not read it as a change file. Keep it: it keeps this
folder in git when there are no change files.
